  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Rockleigh, New Jersey · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Bianca &amp; Bobby<br><em>The Rockleigh</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Bianca and Bobby’s wedding at The Rockleigh, in their GioLina film and a portrait from their wedding day.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>The wedding film</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/720\"><img src=\"/assets/shorts/bianca-bobby.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby, from the existing GioLina portfolio\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/9jzGeDjrO7\" data-film-title=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Bianca &amp; Bobby · A film by GioLina Films</p></section><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">Together on their wedding day.</h2><p>A portrait of Bianca and Bobby.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Bianca and Bobby smiling together in a wedding car\"><img src=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" srcset=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png 617w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"617\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Bianca and Bobby smiling together in a wedding car\"></a></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Bergen County</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">The Rockleigh</h2></div><div><p>The Rockleigh is in Rockleigh, New Jersey. GioLina provided photography and cinematography for Bianca and Bobby; their film is featured here.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://therockleigh.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at The Rockleigh</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/naninas-in-the-park-belleville/\">Nicole &amp; Phil at Nanina’s in the Park</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script><script src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\" defer></script>"
